    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1708427680\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1708427680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1708427680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This multiplayer social deduction game plunges you into an abandoned mansion in the middle of the night with a group of friends. In this 1v1 game, you take on the role of killer or protector. You'll have to act strategically and remain discreet to achieve your goal and win!<br>\u2800<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/2959e90c1419ab76ae2cc6e002a710e6.avif?t=1708427680\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective : Kill a guest list</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find a way to <strong>eliminate </strong>your <strong>targets</strong><br></li><li> Remain <strong>discreet </strong>so as not to attract the protector's attention<br></li><li> Cut the power to take advantage of <strong>darkness</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Clean up</strong> the traces of your crimes</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/2cf376f140d5ce1b5b03cd9f3a214b8c.avif?t=1708427680\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective: Protect the group or shoot the killer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use your <strong>gun </strong>to stop the killer<br></li><li> <strong>Investigate </strong>and <strong>identify </strong>the killer<br></li><li> Set a <strong>trap </strong>for the killer<br></li><li> Identify group members with <strong>suspicious behavior</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every game is different: Many game elements change randomly from game to game<br></li><li> Balancing options available<br></li><li> A wide range of actions available to the player<br></li><li> No one plays an uninteresting role! Simple group members are non-player characters.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1708427680\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1708427680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1708427680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This multiplayer social deduction game plunges you into an abandoned mansion in the middle of the night with a group of friends. In this 1v1 game, you take on the role of killer or protector. You'll have to act strategically and remain discreet to achieve your goal and win!<br>\u2800<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/2959e90c1419ab76ae2cc6e002a710e6.avif?t=1708427680\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective : Kill a guest list</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find a way to <strong>eliminate </strong>your <strong>targets</strong><br></li><li> Remain <strong>discreet </strong>so as not to attract the protector's attention<br></li><li> Cut the power to take advantage of <strong>darkness</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Clean up</strong> the traces of your crimes</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671610/extras/2cf376f140d5ce1b5b03cd9f3a214b8c.avif?t=1708427680\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective: Protect the group or shoot the killer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use your <strong>gun </strong>to stop the killer<br></li><li> <strong>Investigate </strong>and <strong>identify </strong>the killer<br></li><li> Set a <strong>trap </strong>for the killer<br></li><li> Identify group members with <strong>suspicious behavior</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every game is different: Many game elements change randomly from game to game<br></li><li> Balancing options available<br></li><li> A wide range of actions available to the player<br></li><li> No one plays an uninteresting role! Simple group members are non-player characters.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Murder Hunt is a multiplayer social deduction game. A group of friends spend the night in an abandoned mansion. Play as the killer and discreetly eliminate a list of guests, or choose the protector, charged to defend the group with his revolver!",
